@Viajecitos.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5016
@api = http://localhost:5016/api

### Crear carrito
POST {{api}}/Carrito

### Listar destinos (para copiar un id)
GET {{api}}/Destino

### Agregar destino
POST {{api}}/Carrito/ID_CARRITO/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "destinoId": "ID_DESTINO", "cantidad": 2 }

### Ver carrito
GET {{api}}/Carrito/ID_CARRITO

### Cambiar cantidad (0 = quitar)
PUT {{api}}/Carrito/ID_CARRITO/items/ID_ITEM
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cantidad": 3 }

### Quitar ítem
DELETE {{api}}/Carrito/ID_CARRITO/items/ID_ITEM

### Vaciar carrito
DELETE {{api}}/Carrito/ID_CARRITO/items
###
